# Grid table with a colspan

The body cell "A spans" spans columns 1–2: its band's content lines omit the
internal boundary pipe, and the border lines omit the corner at that position
per the corner rule.

+-------+-------+-------+
| H1    | H2    | H3    |
+=======+=======+=======+
| A spans       | B     |
+-------+-------+-------+
| C     | D     | E     |
+-------+-------+-------+
